{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026TAhQwxMON21793182688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國十年期國債孳息率早前一度升越5厘，並較德國同年期國債孳息率高超過1.7厘，創2011年歐債危機以來新高。</p><p></p><p>法、德兩國的國債利率差距擴闊，已拖累歐元貶值，歐元兌美元由9月初1.16水平，跌至目前的1.11水平。</p><p></p><p>這兩個國家的國債利率差距備受市場重視，因為他們兩國的經濟規模總和相當於約一半歐元區的經濟規模，由於法國政府財政赤字高企再受到市場關注，加上該國街頭動亂，更蔓延至歐洲多國，令到法國十年期國債孳息率早前一度升越5厘，推高當地借貸成本，打擊經濟表現。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261028_QQ.YIELD.SPREAD.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026QYTyUk8DeU1793184286.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>相反，歐元區最大經濟體德國，其十年期國債孳息率一直保持在3厘多，令兩國國債利率差距大幅擴大至1.7厘以上。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261028_QQ.YIELD.SPREAD.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jZd7ggSspu1793184309.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當年的歐債危機就是因為希臘、葡萄牙、西班牙及意大利等歐元區國家的國債遭拋售、融資成本急升所引發出來，市場難免憂慮法國事件會引發歐債危機2.0。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/10575-%E4%B8%80%E5%B8%B6%E4%B8%80%E8%B7%AF%E7%B6%A0%E8%89%B2%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E5%A4%A7%E6%9C%83\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:22.067550+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":364,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:29:29.826712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:29.244159+00:00","content_hash":"89a2d1dd51da53a1bee0cf17e7a8ace47914772d60d90a2ded10608f3be257a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:22.067550+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}